              "text": "1.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of the Christ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " took place in this way. When his mother Mary had been betrothed to Joseph, before they came together she was found to be with child of the Holy Spirit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
